      "note": [
        "In this table, 0 means that the proportion is greater than zero but less than 0.5 percent, and that the confidence interval is greater than 0, but less than 0.5 percentage points. The character .. means that the task is not available or too uncertain to indicate.",
        "For enterprises with 10 or more employees, the data for NACE Division 68 (Real estate activities) are based solely on imputed values. For enterprises with 1–9 employees, NACE Division 68 is not included in the survey. The results should therefore be interpreted with some caution. More information is available in the Quality Declaration and the Description of the Production of Statistics on the product page for ICT usage in enterprises: www.scb.se/NV0116 (available in Swedish only)."
